sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(API Consumer)
    participant Ingress as External Ingress<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy / Istio)<br/>TLS Termination
    participant Server as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Embed as Embedding Model<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2)<br/>In-process ONNX
    participant LLM as Upstream LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Chat Completion with Guardrails

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP<br/>X-Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Ingress->>Server: HTTP 8000/TCP<br/>X-Authorization forwarded

    Note over Server: Header Forwarding:<br/>X-Authorization → Authorization<br/>Strips x-forwarded-*, x-real-*, x-request-id

    rect rgb(255, 243, 205)
        Note over Server,Embed: Input Rail Evaluation
        Server->>Embed: Encode user message<br/>(semantic similarity matching)
        Embed-->>Server: Embedding vector
        Server->>LLM: Self-check input rail<br/>POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        LLM-->>Server: Rail evaluation result
        Note over Server: If blocked → return canned response
    end

    rect rgb(212, 232, 212)
        Note over Server,LLM: Main LLM Generation
        Server->>LLM: Forward user message<br/>POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (forwarded)
        LLM-->>Server: LLM response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 224, 224)
        Note over Server,LLM: Output Rail Evaluation
        Server->>LLM: Self-check output rail<br/>(hallucination, sensitive data)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        LLM-->>Server: Rail evaluation result
        Note over Server: If blocked → return canned response
    end

    Server-->>Ingress: HTTP 200 JSON response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS JSON response

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: Guardrail Checks (Fork-Specific)

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP<br/>X-Authorization header
    Ingress->>Server: HTTP 8000/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 230, 250)
        Note over Server: Per-message rail evaluation:<br/>user/system → input rails<br/>assistant → output rails<br/>tool → tool-input rails

        Server->>Embed: Encode messages<br/>(semantic similarity)
        Embed-->>Server: Embeddings

        Server->>LLM: Per-rail LLM evaluation<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP TLS 1.2+
        LLM-->>Server: Rail results
    end

    alt JSON response
        Server-->>Client: HTTP 200<br/>Per-rail pass/block status
    else NDJSON streaming
        Server-->>Client: application/x-ndjson<br/>Incremental per-rail results
    end
